    End_Function

    Procedure ComPrintToDC OLE_HANDLE llhDC Integer llLeft Integer llTop Integer llWidth Integer llHeight
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
        Send PrepareParams to hDispatchDriver 5
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llhDC
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llLeft
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llTop
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llWidth
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llHeight
        Send InvokeComMethod to hDispatchDriver 151 OLE_VT_VOID
    End_Procedure

    Procedure ComPrintElementToDC OLE_HANDLE llhDC Variant llElement Integer llLeft Integer llTop Integer llWidth Integer llHeight
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
        Send PrepareParams to hDispatchDriver 6
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llhDC
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_DISPATCH llElement
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llLeft
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llTop
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llWidth
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llHeight
        Send InvokeComMethod to hDispatchDriver 152 OLE_VT_VOID
    End_Procedure
End_Class

